{"racine_id":"1875272019971067916","n_nodes":12,"max_depth":6,"root_rt":8,"subtree_rt":8,"mass_in_root":1.0,"quote_share":0.2727,"n_reply":8,"n_quote":3,"median_latency_h":0.121,"t_min":1735934665,"t_max":1735987821,"span_h":14.766,"peak_node_id":"1875295849548542102","peak_rt":0,"root_author":"realtommybib","root_text":"🇨🇳 China is facing a new virus outbreak with the Human Metapneumovirus (HMPV) spreading rapidly, causing flu-like and COVID-19-like symptoms. https://t.co/G9YGRYxlf1","root_iso":"2025-01-03T20:04:25Z","nodes":[{"id":"1875272019971067916","x":0.0,"y":2.5,"t":1735934665,"iso":"2025-01-03T20:04:25Z","rt":8,"replies":5,"quotes":2,"likes":25,"relation":"ancre","niveau":0,"author":"realtommybib","author_id":"1658855703400914945","text":"🇨🇳 China is facing a new virus outbreak with the Human Metapneumovirus (HMPV) spreading rapidly, causing flu-like and COVID-19-like symptoms. https://t.co/G9YGRYxlf1","in_corpus":true,"depth":0,"subtree_rt":8,"subtree_size":12,"dt_root_h":0.0,"parent_id":"","conversation_id":"1875272019971067916"},{"id":"1875295849548542102","x":0.106874,"y":5.0,"t":1735940346,"iso":"2025-01-03T21:39:06.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":1,"relation":"reply","niveau":1,"author":"Abidot_chart","author_id":"1672033906659303426","text":"@realtombibiyan Good lord 😩","in_corpus":false,"depth":1,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":1.578,"parent_id":"1875272019971067916","conversation_id":"1875272019971067916"},{"id":"1875278703909073217","x":0.029968,"y":4.0,"t":1735936258,"iso":"2025-01-03T20:30:58.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":1,"author":"OG_DOUGYART","author_id":"1859329663014928391","text":"@realtombibiyan Ye I heard rumours back in 2022 that in 2025 we apparently gonna have same thing happening and lock downs again","in_corpus":false,"depth":1,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":0.443,"parent_id":"1875272019971067916","conversation_id":"1875272019971067916"},{"id":"1875274714341654920","x":0.012078,"y":3.0,"t":1735935307,"iso":"2025-01-03T20:15:07Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":1,"author":"BoldStepPH","author_id":"470773093","text":"@realtombibiyan STOP CREATING PANIC \n\nShould We Be Worried About HMPV?\n\n Doctors note that while HMPV is more common in autumn and winter, it generally causes mild illness and is unlikely to result in severe complications. There’s no need to be overly concerned.","in_corpus":true,"depth":1,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":6,"dt_root_h":0.178,"parent_id":"1875272019971067916","conversation_id":"1875272019971067916"},{"id":"1875488504001765699","x":0.970972,"y":3.0,"t":1735986278,"iso":"2025-01-04T10:24:38.000Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":2,"author":"Mofi_vated","author_id":"753118695795351552","text":"@YiwuNigeria @realtombibiyan Absolutely, but we still can't tell the magnitude to which this virus can get severe.\n\nI was diagnosed with symptoms of this Virus last year September.\nI had never been that sick in all my life that I can remember.\n\nBut thankfully I'm okay today.","in_corpus":false,"depth":2,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":5,"dt_root_h":14.337,"parent_id":"1875274714341654920","conversation_id":"1875272019971067916"},{"id":"1875489012208799769","x":0.973267,"y":3.0,"t":1735986400,"iso":"2025-01-04T10:26:40.000Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":3,"author":"Mofi_vated","author_id":"753118695795351552","text":"@YiwuNigeria @realtombibiyan Btw, I had a contract with a chinese company in Nigeria round the time. \n\nSo technically the source of how I got it...so it's very much in Nigeria already.\n\nWe just have to be conscious of the mode of transmission.\n\nThe new year🎊🎉 was probably what caused the outbreak in China","in_corpus":false,"depth":3,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":4,"dt_root_h":14.371,"parent_id":"1875488504001765699","conversation_id":"1875272019971067916"},{"id":"1875490450808951097","x":0.97972,"y":3.0,"t":1735986743,"iso":"2025-01-04T10:32:23.000Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":4,"author":"BoldStepPH","author_id":"470773093","text":"@Mofi_vated @realtombibiyan Me wey Dey China and going to market everyday for goods procurement is not freaked out except people outside China.\nMake it make sense\n\nSome agents will use this to scam people again","in_corpus":false,"depth":4,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":3,"dt_root_h":14.466,"parent_id":"1875489012208799769","conversation_id":"1875272019971067916"},{"id":"1875493155128390005","x":0.991835,"y":3.0,"t":1735987387,"iso":"2025-01-04T10:43:07.000Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":5,"author":"Mofi_vated","author_id":"753118695795351552","text":"@YiwuNigeria @realtombibiyan Chief, I have a friend in China too and he's  good.🙂\n\nPeople are only reacting based on the unknown magnitude too which this virus could potentially get🙂\n\nI'm just sharing my experience of the virus.\n\nAnd you're right!, sadly this could be used as a scam too.","in_corpus":false,"depth":5,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":2,"dt_root_h":14.645,"parent_id":"1875490450808951097","conversation_id":"1875272019971067916"},{"id":"1875494973266915423","x":1.0,"y":3.0,"t":1735987821,"iso":"2025-01-04T10:50:21.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":6,"author":"BoldStepPH","author_id":"470773093","text":"@Mofi_vated @realtombibiyan That’s exactly what I’m saying . People outside are over reacting. This is normal during the holidays due to large gathering of crowds and the cold weather. \nAside that, the flu isn’t deadly just the normal cold and catarrh effects 🤷‍♀️","in_corpus":false,"depth":6,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":14.766,"parent_id":"1875493155128390005","conversation_id":"1875272019971067916"},{"id":"1875272540308042065","x":0.002333,"y":2.0,"t":1735934789,"iso":"2025-01-03T20:06:29.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"quote","niveau":1,"author":"realtommybib","author_id":"1658855703400914945","text":"@baros_alter68er @BRICSNews https://t.co/YRmBscpa61 https://t.co/isolJ00zYL","in_corpus":false,"depth":1,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":0.034,"parent_id":"1875272019971067916","conversation_id":"1875271787694715372"},{"id":"1875272478907650074","x":0.002051,"y":1.0,"t":1735934774,"iso":"2025-01-03T20:06:14.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":1,"relation":"quote","niveau":1,"author":"realtommybib","author_id":"1658855703400914945","text":"@theworlldindex https://t.co/YRmBscpa61 https://t.co/isolJ00zYL","in_corpus":false,"depth":1,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":0.03,"parent_id":"1875272019971067916","conversation_id":"1875272227882725867"},{"id":"1875272455025295384","x":0.001938,"y":0.0,"t":1735934768,"iso":"2025-01-03T20:06:08.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"quote","niveau":1,"author":"realtommybib","author_id":"1658855703400914945","text":"@OmegaXDreams https://t.co/YRmBscpa61 https://t.co/isolJ00zYL","in_corpus":false,"depth":1,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":0.029,"parent_id":"1875272019971067916","conversation_id":"1875272305242484754"}],"edges":[{"source":"1875272019971067916","target":"1875272455025295384","relation":"quote"},{"source":"1875272019971067916","target":"1875272478907650074","relation":"quote"},{"source":"1875272019971067916","target":"1875272540308042065","relation":"quote"},{"source":"1875272019971067916","target":"1875274714341654920","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1875272019971067916","target":"1875278703909073217","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1875272019971067916","target":"1875295849548542102","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1875274714341654920","target":"1875488504001765699","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1875488504001765699","target":"1875489012208799769","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1875489012208799769","target":"1875490450808951097","relatio